Good for those with gastrointestinal sensitivities to milk, whey, soy and other  protein source\n-Increases the protein content of meals-just add to food and beverages\n-Easily digested-supports digestive health and function with live probiotics and protein-digesting enzymes\n-Suitable for vegetarian and vegan diets\n-Mixes well-great in shakes, smoothies and other beverages"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"RAW"},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"VEGAN"},{"type":"Formulation re: Organic","notes":"ORGANIC"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Use low fat RAW Protein(TM) to increase the protein content of meals-just add to food or beverages. It mixes instantly and has a neutral taste, making it an excellent foundation for refreshing, high protein energy shake or smoothie. RAW Protein(TM) is suitable for almost anyone, including those on vegetarian or vegan diets, those on low carbohydrate diets or those with gastrointestinal sensitivities to milk, whey, soy or other protein source."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"RAW Protein(TM) provides a complete suite of essential amino acids. For more information on the amino acid profile visit us at www.gardenoflife.com"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Your decision to purchase organic is not only an investment in your health, but in the health of the planet for generations to come."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"RP622L-011111-022311"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Excellent Source of Protein from RAW Organic Sprouts\n17 Grams Per Serving"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"RAW Food Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Garden of Life(R) RAW Protein(TM) - Beyond Organic Protein\nUnlock the nutritive power of living grains and seeds with Garden of Life(R) RAW Protein(TM) - a certified organic, RAW, vegan protein powder. Featuring 13 RAW and organic sprouts, RAW Protein(TM) is an excellent source of complete protein-providing 17 grams and 33% of the Daily Value - including all essential amino acids. RAW Protein(TM) contains VITAMIN CODE(R) RAW Food-Created fat-soluble vitamins A, D, E and K and supports digestive health and function with live probiotics and protein-digesting enzymes."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Go Beyond Organic with Garden of Life(R) RAW Protein-providing high quality, plant based protein plus live probiotics and enzymes, fat-soluble vitamins and nutrient Code Factors(TM) such as Beta-glucans, SOD, glutathione and CoQ10 for overall health and vitality."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Adults mix 1 level scoop (scoop included) in 8 ounces of water or juice one (or more) times per day."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Not intended for children."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"CAUTION: As with any dietary supplement, consult your healthcare practitioner before using this product, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, anticipate surgery, take medication on a regular basis or are otherwise under medical supervision."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"RAW(R)"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Fat-Soluble Vitamins A, D, E, K\nLive Probiotics and Enzymes"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Fillers, Artificial Flavors or Synthetic Nutrients"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"USDA\nORGANIC"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Contains no filler ingredients, artificial colors  or preservatives."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if safety seal is broken or missing."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"VITAMIN CODE(R)"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"CERTIFIED RENEWABLE ENERGY(R)\neb\nGreen-e.org"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"GLUTEN FREE-DAIRY FREE-LACTOSE FREE-NO FILLERS-NO ISOLATES-NO SYNTHETIC NUTRIENTS NO ARTIFICIAL SWEETENERS-NO PRESERVATIVES"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"We Buy 100% Certified Renewable Energy"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Made in the U.S.A."},{"type":"Formulation re: Organic","notes":"Certified Organic by QAI"}],"targetGroups":["Vegan","Vegetarian","Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Organic","Gluten Free","Dairy Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}